1170	    //    (apply_optimizer<Prodigy>) reads st.d_factor (the effective LR scale d),
1171	    //    a GLOBAL reduction over EVERY element of EVERY tensor. We compute it here,
1172	    //    BYTE-FAITHFUL to the live eager multi-tensor path (prodigy_sm90.cuh:465-
1173	    //    544, the order prodigy.py → _ops.prodigy_fused_step actually executes):
1174	    //      d_prev  = persisted d_lr  (step 1: d0 cold-start — the zero-init state
1175	    //                slot would give d_prev=0 ⇒ d=0 ⇒ frozen params; eager inits
1176	    //                _d_lr=d0=1e-6, so seed it here, the grokfast-style step-1 fix)
1177	    //      r_ema  <- beta3·r_ema + Σ d_prev²·<g, p0−p>     (decay persisted SCALAR,
1178	    //      s_ema  <- beta3·s_ema + Σ d_prev²·|g|            then add this step's Σ)
1179	    //      d       = max(d_prev, d_coef·r_ema/|s_ema|)      (prodigy_update_d; d_coef
1180	    //                scales ONLY the candidate — persisted r_ema stays UNSCALED)
1181	    //
1182	    //    DETERMINISM — FIXED-PARTITION reduction (mirrors the A/A/A-CLEAN GrokAdamW
